# AdaptIQ Platform Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to client/.env and fill in your keys.

# ==============================================================================
# 1. GOOGLE GEMINI AI API KEY (For 24/7 Socratic AI Tutor & Chatbot)
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Powers real-time AI responses, step-by-step math derivations,
# analogy generator, and contextual student chat in AITutorChat and floating drawer.
# How to get:
# 1. Go to Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Click "Create API Key" (Free tier available)
# 3. Paste the key below:
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ==============================================================================
# 2. WEB3FORMS ACCESS KEY (Contact Us, Feedback, Bug Reports & Registration)
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Delivers contact inquiries, user feedback, bug reports, and registration
# records directly to your verified support email via the Web3Forms submission API
# without requiring an SMTP server, server secrets, or email backend maintenance.
# Official Docs: https://docs.web3forms.com/
# How to get:
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your destination email address to generate an access key instantly.
# 3. Paste the access key below (e.g. 12345678-abcd-ef01-2345-6789abcdef01):
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

# ==============================================================================
# 3. GOOGLE OAUTH CLIENT ID (For Google Sign-In & Registration)
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Enables Google One-Tap / OAuth 2.0 login on AuthScreen.
# (If not provided, AdaptIQ uses pre-configured one-click demo Google profiles).
# How to get:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web Application)
# 3. Add Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173
# 4. Paste the Client ID below:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
